# Secrets: ATCODER_REVEL_SESSION (login cookie) and YUKICODER_API_KEY.
# Never commit to ANY repository; copy .env.example to .env locally instead.
#
# This lives next to the file it protects, rather than only in the repo-root
# .gitignore, so that it travels with .devcontainer/ into every repository
# this directory is published to.
/.env
